### Progress Check Warnings
```python
# ✅ GOOD - Check and report progress status
def run_checks(progress: str) -> None:
    if progress:
        print(
            f"Tokenization is still in progress. Currently {progress}% done.",
            flush=True,
        )
        print("Function will run with reduced set.", flush=True)

# ❌ BAD - Ignore progress warnings
def run_checks(progress: str) -> None:
    pass  # May cause issues if tokenization incomplete
```
